  m_text: "ARCADE WALLBALL \u2022 FIRST TO 11, WIN BY TWO \u2022 RALLY SCORING.\n\nOne
    to four trucks per team share the court and pass through each other. Drive and
    jump at any time in a rally. Any teammate on the eligible team can return. One
    enlarged ball-only contact envelope gives forgiving reach; it never changes scenery
    collisions. Eligibility changes never freeze movement; separate from an overlapping
    ball to arm a fresh physical contact.\n\nPhysically hit the ball into the highlighted
    front wall before it touches the floor. A legal wall contact makes the opposing
    TEAM eligible. Volley it, or return after one floor bounce; SECOND BOUNCE loses
    the rally. A floor contact before reaching the wall is MISSED WALL. Invalid wall
    contact or side/rear escape is OUT against the responsible hitter, even if the
    receiver declines an out ball. Every rally awards one point; the winner serves
    next.\n\nSERVE: drive from the marked service box into the reachable ball. You
    have 25 active serving seconds. Countdown/pause do not consume this time. The
    opening server alternates on rematches. Genuine simulation failures replay neutrally
    with unchanged score.\n\nKeyboard defaults: W/A/S/D + SPACE jump; arrows + RIGHT
    SHIFT jump. Whole pad: left stick steer, RT/LT drive/brake, SOUTH/A/Cross jump.
    Shared pad: LEFT STICK + LT jump; RIGHT STICK + RT jump. North joins. Esc/Start
    pauses. Actual assigned controls appear in setup/HUD. Reconnect/reassign requires
    release and fresh confirmation; confirmation never becomes a jump.\n\nThese are
    simplified arcade rules, not an official tournament ruleset."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
